<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian currency reserves up one pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Austrian currency reserves up one pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves rose one percent to 190.313 billion schillings in September, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    AUSTRIAN RESERVES	    Sept 1996	 Aug 1996</p>
<p>    Reserves (bln ATS)	   190.313	   188.466</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
